-- GetSkillLineInfo() returns. Matching on the name is what lets the addon ask 'does
-- this character have that proficiency' without a server round trip.
--
-- A value of `false` means item_template asks for a skill line that SkillLine.dbc
-- does not contain -- six vanilla leftovers do. Neither the client nor the server can
-- give anybody such a skill, so PlayerCanUseItem would reject those items for every
